{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f5ddde9814a9ab53f81ccf1d3f08f9f32ffcc9bf33dda868295592583caa9c4", "ja": "（セクシービーストプロジェクトとのダンスバトル\n……みんな、素晴らしいパフォーマンスだったな）", "zh": "（和性感野兽企划的舞蹈对决……大家的表演都精彩极了啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1001_p", "source_sha256": "33c7c6adcc4bb268c81d1ae711dfba4b49f97902682ecedcc9b0df9a2cb9c106", "ja": "……？\n伊織、難しい顔して、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "……？\n伊织，一脸严肃的样子，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "2faa61162c26a46a707038c024a55c770bac0cece1794815a152b891931d9cab", "ja": "ダンスバトルのことを思い出してたのよ。\nもっとやれることがあったんじゃないか、って。", "zh": "我刚才想起了舞蹈对决的事。\n我是不是本来还能做得更好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1003_p", "source_sha256": "0186751ec3650c693bd155a5de729b4e139d7db6a8f23cfe204d5ad829b91760", "ja": "そうか？　伊織のダンスで、オーディエンスも\nすごく盛り上がっていたと思うけど……。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得观众也因为伊织的舞蹈而特别兴奋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "d7d753d6d1c3421121533a2464646d324dc5a1d17a4602cc91865e24bbea2cdb", "ja": "当然よ、練習したもの。……でも、\n相手チームや、歩のダンスを改めて見て思ったの。", "zh": "那是当然，我可是练过的。……但是，\n重新看了对手队伍还有步的舞蹈之后，我就在想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "a396ea78feadbbe9e7277cbeb40df70ec7cc75fd97c99233ecc7780dc66fe795", "ja": "私だって、もっとやれたんじゃないかって。\nでもそれって、心残りがあるってことでしょ？", "zh": "我也觉得，自己是不是本可以做得更好。\n但这说明，我还有遗憾，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "c2fc19e10147457849d2037eb3ca3b68470dc70c50933c49c7eac3ea0db24680", "ja": "雰囲気に圧倒されて、飲まれてたんじゃないかって……\nそんな風に考えちゃう自分に、イライラするのよ。", "zh": "我是不是被那种氛围压倒，完全被它吞没了……一想到自己居然会这么想，就觉得很火大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aa5ccdd423a55fa066b742ae03fc8ae46200878cb07bece03a616afc5a29cf6b", "ja": "……その気持ちがあれば、大丈夫だよ。\n今回の経験が、きっと次に活きるはずだ。", "zh": "……只要有这份心情，就没问题的。\n这次的经验，一定能在下次派上用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "f54c38f4ee2598dc7c3d73fc4d7991efcda61796a643c67f2f8a28c50d2c4dc1", "ja": "ええ。もし次があるなら、その時はもっとすごい\nパフォーマンスで、みんなを圧倒してみせるわ！", "zh": "是的。如果还有下一次，到那时我会用更加精彩的表演，让大家为之折服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3b2aa82ffb8c7e2387e00241a09ee36ee156f1d6eea375057378693fbe466b93", "ja": "そうだな。とはいえ、こんな風にダンスバトルを\nする機会なんて、そうないだろうけど……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，像这样进行舞蹈对决的机会，应该不会有很多吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "b8c1c38f043017e197cb55e2944caa7e692e4c904f23cabb51c0066cede47300", "ja": "うーん……そうだわ！　{$P$}、　\nアンタが私の練習に付き合いなさい。", "zh": "嗯……对了！{$P$}，你陪我练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d3d0cab50715f95201724aebb562b9fa652306477b5eb9e9e7f9dfec48dad167", "ja": "構わないけど……まさか、ダンスをしろって意味じゃ\nないよな？　いや、それはいくらなんでも……。", "zh": "我倒是没问题……不过，你该不会是要我跳舞吧？不，那也未免太强人所难了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "4a89ffb6964a4a801acbbfec3ad71eeff97895fb4c900e86b6942648c6676a73", "ja": "アンタのダンスになんか期待してないわよ！\nアンタはただ、近くで見てるだけでいいの。", "zh": "我才没期待你的舞蹈呢！\n你只要在近处看着就行了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "bee9e96008f51179ccbf00d2df5b22eb3083a9eafcab5af62e2f7509c7e12f58", "ja": "ただし、いつもより近くでね！\nこっちのダンスを品定めしてくる、あの感じよ。", "zh": "不过，要比平时站得更近哦！\n就是那种来品评我的舞蹈的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fd3d043e5a6a6cb41fb571960e96d9a50b565ccb844c9f8e88c75e89f56456e0", "ja": "なるほど、要は対戦相手役として、踊る伊織の\n近くに立つって事か。……それで、練習になるのか？", "zh": "原来如此，也就是说，要扮演对手，站在跳舞的伊织身边啊。……这样真的能练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "367fa196a8ac1b43dd17c3baafadfb37501c7a3fc5bb4281e674c5f113e5e97d", "ja": "何？　私のダンスなんて、\n見てられないとでも言いたいわけ？", "zh": "什么？你是想说，我的舞蹈根本没法看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4bef3bf64c0445292e1a8bc2d4ac35394ae71847038521bba43d2cd0402bcd01", "ja": "そんな事はないけど……わかった。\n伊織が納得するまで、練習に付き合うよ。", "zh": "不是那回事，不过……好吧。直到伊织满意为止，我陪你练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "e686e72e16635960bfc84efed346c8d859e0098b1eba50383bed53324321a3f0", "ja": "ならいいの。それじゃ早速だけど、\nレッスンルームを押さえてちょうだい。", "zh": "那就好。那我就不客气了，\n去把练习室订下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "67269714d528ce93eb36da31d489b38d0d5ee92e5bb24a8d74885b3d4bf76bd2", "ja": "伊織ちゃんのダンスを特等席で見られるんですもの、\n感謝するといいわ！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "能在特等席观看伊织的舞蹈，你可要好好感谢我哦！嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0373_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0373_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c658679e42105d898cb8b85e01df2f510c5dada044d015e26c7d7a506aab0b09", "ja": "（この負けず嫌いは、美徳でもある。伊織自身が\n満足できるダンス……相当なレベルになりそうだ）", "zh": "（这份不服输的性格，也算是一种美德。伊织自己都能满意的舞蹈……看来会达到相当高的水平）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
